AC-7.4
GIVEN Generate Report is re-run for the same team + fix version
WHEN commit_analysis_status is written again
THEN existing rows are updated (UPSERT) — no duplicate rows are created

AC-7.5
GIVEN a component has scrum teams ["Team Alpha", "Team Beta"] in the components table
WHEN its commit_analysis_status row is written
